    {
      "id": "mara",
      "name": "Mara Okonkwo",
      "role": "crane signaller",
      "persona": "Twenty years of hand signals in wind and rain, she trusts what she sees from forty metres up. Blunt, watchful, and protective of her crew.",
      "knowledge": [
        "Stack Row C was lifted in last night's dark by the night shift, not on the plan.",
        "The stopped reefer sits second tier, near the aisle end, where the drones never look.",
        "Tomas asked her to hold the boom off that row until his lashers had finished."
      ],
      "secrets": [
        "She saw a straddle carrier pull out of Row C before the gate opened and said nothing."
      ],
