    {
      "id": "lin",
      "name": "Lin Wei",
      "role": "gate clerk",
      "persona": "Precise and dry, she logs every truck in and out and resents being asked twice. Quietly curious about anything that does not add up.",
      "knowledge": [
        "Gate-in records show the reefer arrived on a night slot with a driver whose licence number was typed twice.",
        "Its paper manifest weighs forty tonnes less than the gate scale read.",
        "A tag copy of the seal paperwork is filed in the Gate Hut under the clipped bin."
      ],
      "secrets": [
        "She waved the truck through at 3 a.m. after a call she cannot trace."
